{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（24日）早上10時22分，太子西洋菜北街225號美邦大廈地下一間酒吧，據報有一名年約40多歲的男子墮地，頭部受傷，身上疑有傷口，呈半昏迷狀態。救援人員到場將他送往明愛醫院救治。</p><p>現場可見，酒吧內地面遺有血跡。警方正調查事件，案件暫列「傷人」跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場為太子西洋菜北街美邦大廈地下一間酒吧。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190638329624793088296814.jpeg/4wAXwVKF0fV5n5Yu20i_-RlRhGqRgP291RJJsNUSSbA\"/><figcaption>現場為太子西洋菜北街美邦大廈地下一間酒吧。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"酒吧地面遺下血跡。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190638332560936960019723.jpeg/4PtzGmwrc0xdrKvmw-MWx-KSCkg_4R4-Q-rixEPq4sQ\"/><figcaption>酒吧地面遺下血跡。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為太子西洋菜北街美邦大廈地下一間酒吧。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190638335304142848973152.jpeg/v69_hCajNNMyBfycWjCLFN4qhaDsfZj5hPlxvIT5cbw\"/><figcaption>現場為太子西洋菜北街美邦大廈地下一間酒吧。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員圍封現場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190639385998004224651827.jpeg/5qV_JWXk2wmyIJ-B8EKZCWrXY8GmLozOJVcoJA9XKCQ\"/><figcaption>警員圍封現場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:04:35.256447+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T04:46:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T05:18:23.982191+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T04:58:26.337285+00:00","content_hash":"ded76611319948eb15cd13066c98a85a0d2e24070a04c34c3e2ce12b1c93a7e9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}